WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.991 --> 00:00:03.025
code-style's SKILL.md has a badge: it is one link, "build", to the CI, not to badge.svg

2
00:00:03.025 --> 00:00:05.044
An image alone, "See ![logo](https://example.com/logo.png).", is a link to it, its text "logo"

3
00:00:05.044 --> 00:00:07.058
A link in a link's text, "[a [b](b.md) c](c.md)": only "b" is a link

4
00:00:07.058 --> 00:00:09.098
Balanced brackets stay in a link's text: "Read [the [beta] guide](…)." is "Read the [beta] guide."
